# Real III+ forms captures replayed by test_ibase_forms_replay (initech-nic17).
# `case DIR` replays a pinned case. `elsewhere DIR reason` names a pinned case
# this replay cannot run and the test that grades it instead.
# `differs DIR ITEM SPEC reason` records a known disagreement: ITEM is
# dump:NAME or export:FILE; SPEC is what may differ (rows:A-B, cursor,
# bytes:N or bytes:A-B, lines:N, absent; joined by +). Everything outside
# SPEC must still equal the capture, and the part inside must still differ.
case forms-f01-dotget
case forms-f02b-bounds
case forms-f02c-home
case forms-f02d-end
case forms-f02-order
case forms-f03a-esc
case forms-f03b-pgdn
case forms-f03c-pgup
case forms-f03d-ctrlend
case forms-f03e-ctrlw
case forms-f03f-ctrlq
case forms-f03g-escoff
case forms-f04-edit
case forms-f05a-confirm-off
case forms-f05b-confirm-on
case forms-f06a-delim
case forms-f06b-intoff
case forms-f06c-delimstr
case forms-f07-num
case forms-f08-date
case forms-f09-logic
case forms-f10-mask
case forms-f11-func
case forms-f12-list
case forms-f13a-bind
case forms-f13b-memvar
case forms-f13c-recmove
case forms-f14-bell
