case forms-f20m-logical
case forms-f20n-reload
case forms-f21a-words
case forms-f21b-aliases
case forms-f21c-exits

# Known disagreements, each with its cause.

# Known disagreements: what may differ, then the cause.
differs forms-f01-dotget export:OUT.MEM bytes:18+bytes:59+bytes:99 SAVE TO writes 2, real 0, at byte 18 for dot-prompt variables (initech-fae7j)
